WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:05.020
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.020
Hey, Nakaji.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.150
Do "zoom" again.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.900
No way. I'm tuckered out.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.030
Hey! Excuse me!

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.750
Don't you come over to our house 
to play a dad on Sunday.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.500
You're in the way.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.130
Souta!

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.550
Why is Rinko here?

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.750
Because...

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.850
Tomorrow's the anniversary 
of our mom's death.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:48.670
<b>Poco's Udon World</b>

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:13.400
Episode 10: "The Reservoir"

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.370
You look just like a dad.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:13.610
Shut up.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.130
Zoom!

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.740
I just can't seem to unwind.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.740
Zoom! Zoom!

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.490
What's wrong? Have another fight with your dad?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.120
Turns out I'm gonna do marriage interviews.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.160
Marriage interviews, huh?

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:32.260
Oh, Auntie Taeko nags Souta about those, too.

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.680
Yeah.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:35.560
Huh?!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:36.700
Who's doing it?

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:37.730
Me.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:38.840
You're kidding me!

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:39.760
I'm serious.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:44.260
My ma's been naggin' me 
about it for the longest time.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.690
She finally got me to give in by crying.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.140
I know I'm nagging, but...

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.650
Can't you do it just as a formality?

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:57.070
To put your mother's mind at ease a little?

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.780
Argh! Okay, okay!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.950
I'll do it, so stop cryin', will ya?

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:06.740
So even you listen when your mom cries to you...

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.500
Anybody would.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:09.940
Oh, yeah?

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.530
Is that how it is?

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:15.810
I can't remember ever seeing our mom cry.

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.480
What are ya sayin'?

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.050
Huh?

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.530
You ain't married. Don't got a girlfriend.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.630
And, on top of that, you've got a kid.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.070
If Mom were alive to see this, 
you bet she'd be cryin'.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.620
Anyhow, the cleaning's done.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.020
Should we make some lunch?

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.850
Lunch! Lunch!

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:36.050
Shinobu-chan, you're gonna 
eat here, too, right?

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:39.880
"We"? You'll be drinking sake while I make it...

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.150
No. You sit down an' wait.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:42.800
Huh?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.950
I won't be drinkin'.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:47.280
Today...

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.580
I'm cookin'!

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.830
Huh? Why?

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.540
What brought about this turn of events?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.240
Yummy?

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.540
But you can't cook, right?

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.800
Hey! It's not that I <i>can't</i> cook.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.120
I just don't.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:02.350
Uh...

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:05.050
Maybe I should go home.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:10.000
Rin, what are you making?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.060
Hmm? It's a surprise.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:16.440
Poco-chan, knives are dangerous, 
so stay back now, you hear?

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.560
What's she making in there?

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.570
It smells pretty good, like sesame oil...

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:29.360
Hey, Souta. Is it just me, 
or is Rinko actin' funny?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:29.970
Huh?

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.800
Is it trouble at home?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.080
No way...

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.710
<b>I don't need a heavy-drinking wife who can't cook.</b>

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.710
<b>Whaaat?</b>

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:36.710
<b>Divorce</b>

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:36.140
Divorce?!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.570
Food's ready!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.420
Here. It's Manba no Ken-chan.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.930
Ken-chan? Who's that?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.560
Ken-chan means kenchin. 
That's tofu and veggies.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.660
Eat up, now!

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.200
Rinko's cooking...

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.840
Huh? Somethin' wrong, you two?

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:10.890
N-No, it's nothing.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.960
Let's eat!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.180
Huh?! Poco!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.200
Huh? Is it good?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:24.020
Nah, he'll eat anything. 
Ya can't count on him.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.110
Excuse me!

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:27.760
Look at him.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.260
He obviously thinks it's... good...

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.200
Hey! He's frozen!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.270
Poco?!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.960
What the heck did you make?

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.600
What is this? So bitter...

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:46.530
There's this awful bitter 
taste in my mouth...

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.590
Sis, did you boil the manba leaves?

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:50.160
Huh?

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.910
Raw manba has a harsh taste. 
You have to boil it out!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.410
I didn't know that...

00:05:56.650 --> 00:06:00.610
Jeez, if it's beyond you, then don't cook!

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:04.270
Souta!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:08.070
Sis... Er, I...

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:10.760
Even if it's beyond me...

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:12.830
Even if it's beyond me,

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:15.680
this time, I wanted to get good at it!

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:26.190
She's a pain in the neck.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.980
How long are ya gonna follow me?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.740
Hey! What's so funny?

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:13.810
It's just...

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:17.870
This same thing happened 
before. Do ya remember?

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:21.130
It was when Souta hurt 
his leg in that accident.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:24.830
Remember how he hit his head

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.540
and didn't wake up for two days?

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.040
When you an' I were goin' home 
after a hospital visit,

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.240
we walked around the reservoir 
again and again, just like now.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.140
How long are ya gonna follow me?

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.650
Until ya stop cryin'.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:53.620
Don't cry! You're overreactin'.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:57.070
My pa said Souta would be fine, didn't he?

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:59.080
That he'll wake up real soon.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:04.150
It was the same when our mom was sick.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.120
They said she'd be better soon.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.200
They said she'd be out of the hospital 
before we knew it, and then she...

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.390
Shinobu-chan!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:15.070
Oh, God! What if Souta dies?

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.310
This rain came out of nowhere...

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.410
It's pourin' pretty hard.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:22.950
It'll clear up soon.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.630
Oh, yeah. Your marriage interviews...

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.690
Hope ya find someone nice.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.370
I'm only doin' it for the sake of formality.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:43.110
Your taste in women is pretty bad.

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:45.830
Marriage interviews might 
be just the thing for you.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.210
Hey, you...

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:59.200
I'm tellin' you this 'cause it 
was a long time ago now, but...

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.310
Way back when, I...

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.880
I had this crush on you.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.190
Oh, really?

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:12.610
"Oh, really"?!

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.030
Well, thinking about it now,

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:18.330
I might have had this feeling 
that maybe you did.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.620
Are you kidding me? What's with that?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.830
Women are scary. Scary!

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:24.050
But...

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:25.210
Huh?

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:31.430
I've always thought of you like family.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.850
No, you are<i> family.</i>

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:40.090
Family? Even though we're not related?

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:44.010
You don't have to be related to be family.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.600
I had my concerns about it,

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.700
but even Souta and Poco-chan...

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:54.580
They're a real family now, aren't they?

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.350
Souta won't say anything about it,

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:02.620
but I know he plans on raising 
Poco-chan as his own.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:08.190
Will he be a good parent?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.600
Family, huh?

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.590
Ah, don't!

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.090
No smoking!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.840
Huh? Why not?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.140
You've never said a word 
against smoking before!

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.710
Are you harassing me? Ticks me off!

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.100
Sorry, sorry.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.120
Shinobu-chan.

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:40.660
Listen...

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.160
Soon, I'm...

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.310
gonna be a mom.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:54.930
What?

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:02.330
Rinko, what do you want 
to be when you grow up?

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.110
I wanna be...

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:09.020
A mom like you!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:21.470
Souta, stop cryin'.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:24.910
If ya keep cryin', Mom'll be worried up in Heaven.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:29.410
From now on, I'll be your mom, so...

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:32.520
So... don't you cry, now...

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:37.420
<i>I gotta keep things together.</i>

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.620
<i>Like Mom did.</i>

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.310
<i>I gotta...</i>

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.240
Hot!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.080
Rinko, ya made this all by yourself?

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:48.810
Yeah!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:52.940
Mm! It's great.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.930
It musta been a lot of work. Thanks.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.330
I don't like it.

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:03.580
Souta! Your sister worked hard to cook this for us.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:04.820
How can you say that?

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:05.910
But...

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:09.830
It doesn't taste like Mom's.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:15.330
I wanna eat Mom's cooking...

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.680
Mom!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:23.760
Souta...

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:27.440
Me, too...

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.770
I wanna eat

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.940
Mom's cooking, too.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.610
I wanna see Mom!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.570
<i>Oh... I remember now.</i>

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.370
<i>It's the same as back then.</i>

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.870
<i>She did her best, and I hurt her.</i>

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.910
This time, I wanted to get good at it!

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:56.440
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.720
Souta?

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:00.730
Poco.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.190
I...

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.250
have to apologize to my sister.

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:13.690
You're gonna be a mom?

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.440
Huh? Seriously?!

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:17.070
Yep.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.840
Really?

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.290
No kidding?

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.030
Congrats.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.430
I knew you were actin' funny.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.250
I never thought you'd <i>want</i> to cook.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.870
A long time ago,

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:41.410
I tried cookin' in Mom's place.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.340
But Souta said he didn't like it.

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:48.590
That guy hasn't learned his lesson, huh?

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:52.130
Well, we were both still just kids back then.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.660
But I think he could

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:57.290
still sense that I was hurting.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.250
Sis... I'm sorry...

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.240
I'll help out, too!

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:08.130
The next day, we started cookin' together.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.740
And before I knew it...

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:11.090
Sis!

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:13.500
I made this. How's this look?

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:17.120
Souta had become a better cook than me.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.450
The mom in him had already awakened...

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.380
<b>Souta 
Incoming Call</b>

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:25.380
Speak of the devil.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.470
Souta, hurry!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.850
Wait for me, Poco!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.600
Ocean!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.880
No, Poco.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.640
This is a lake. It's a reservoir.

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.790
Poco-chan!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.990
It's Rin!

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:53.170
Rin! Nakaji!

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:56.960
Souta says he'll say sorry!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.260
Stop! I wasn't ready!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.460
Rin!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.300
Uh, Sis?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.620
I'm sorry for earlier.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.760
I was too harsh.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.750
It's okay.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:17.370
I should say sorry, too.

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:21.120
Sorry for giving you that icky stuff.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.550
I'll practice lots,

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.610
so I can make yummy food.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.430
I'll eat lots of

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:31.070
Rin's yummy food!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.060
Poco-chan, thank you!

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.010
I love you!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.280
It's a weird feeling, huh?

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:44.030
Knowin' Rinko's gonna be a mom.

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:46.210
Huh? Uh, what's he talking about?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.520
Ah! I hadn't told Souta!

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:49.090
Huh?

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.550
What?!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.850
How could you tell Nakajima 
before you told me?

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:05.310
Jeez! You griped about that all yesterday.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:06.580
When are you gonna let it go?

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.480
You could've told me.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.230
Come on! It's not like that.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.920
I planned on tellin' ya today,

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:14.990
at the same time as Mom and Dad.

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:24.840
Mom? You know...

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:29.050
For the longest time, I've been scared 
about whether I could ever be a good mom.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.550
<b>Tawara Family Grave</b>

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:34.010
I'm still an awful cook.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:37.300
I only started thinking little kids

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:39.870
were cute after meeting Poco, too.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:41.740
Sis...

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.060
Truth is, I still don't know if I can do it.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:47.560
Can I...

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.230
really be a mom?

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:56.910
Can I, Mom?

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:08.120
Souta? What's...

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.840
Dad!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:19.360
When I grow up, I wanna be cool

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:22.370
like you and make handmade udon!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.880
But you're a crybaby.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:27.950
You have to grow out of that first!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.360
Am not!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:34.790
Rinko, what do you want 
to be when you grow up?

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.240
I wanna be...

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.260
A mom like you!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:46.130
But I'm not good at helping you cook.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.700
Oh, no... Can I really do it?

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.240
Of course you can.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:55.400
You're so responsible.

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:58.970
You'll be the best mom in the whole world.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:03.120
I guarantee it!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.770
Mom...

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:12.150
Mom.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.000
Mom!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.070
Huh?

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:30.580
Just now...

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:33.810
Rin.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.630
Poco-chan...

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:40.410
I can guarantee it, too.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.620
You'll be a great mom.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.870
You looked after me,

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:48.770
so I'd know.

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:50.850
Yeah.

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.530
Thanks.

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:02.660
Hoi, hoi, hoi, hoi...

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.920
What's that song?

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.270
Funny song!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.420
Hoi, hoi, hoi...

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:13.200
When I grow up, I wanna be cool

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.270
like you and make handmade udon!

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.430
<i>Am I remembering all these things</i>

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.440
<i>because we came here?</i>

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:23.860
<i>Or because of...</i>

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.690
Souta!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.910
Jeez, why are ya spacin' out?

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.440
Hurry!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.740
Sorry, sorry.

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:40.140
<i>Hey, Poco. It's really curious, isn't it?</i>

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.090
All right!

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:45.520
I'm gonna be as good of a mom as Souta!

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:47.510
Huh? "Mom"?!

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:10.950
<b>Gaogao-chan and</b>

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:10.950
<b>The Blue Sky</b>

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.870
<i>The Tale of Gaogao-chan</i>

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:16.960
<b>Episode 10: "Gaogao-chan 
and The Great Monster Battle"</b>

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:16.410
<i>and The Great Monster Battle!</i>

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:24.680
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:25.840
<i>What the heck?</i>

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:29.380
<i>Yummy, yummy!</i>

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:31.040
<i>Wh-What's happening?</i>

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:35.480
<i>They're the hungry giant monsters, 
Pegyora and Gumomo!</i>

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.600
<i>Yummy, yummy.</i>

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:40.860
<i>Oh, no! They're gonna eat up our workshop!</i>

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.240
<i>Not on my watch!</i>

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.660
<i>Nowatch!</i>

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:47.740
<i>Yummy, yummy!</i>

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:51.120
<i>Go get 'em!</i>

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.200
<i>At this rate, Gaogao-chan will lose.</i>

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:54.620
<i>What?</i>

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:57.440
<i>While Gaogao-chan defends against Pegyora,</i>

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:59.880
<i>Gumomo will hit him.</i>

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>You mean it's two on one?</i>

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:04.260
<i>I'm afraid so.</i>

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:05.970
<i>If this goes on...</i>

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>I know! The scar on his back!</i>

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:10.140
<i>The mark of a champion?</i>

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:11.390
<i>Ready!</i>

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:18.690
<i>The finishing blow! Quickly!</i>

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:26.000
<i>Thanks to Gaogao-chan,</i>

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>peace on Earth was protected once again.</i>

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:31.080
<i>Gao?</i>

